{"step_index":188,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T08:39:58Z","thinking":"**Investigating Nginx Configuration**\n\nConsidering capturing Nginx's upstream communication or using a listening tool. The presence of root/sudo access on a specific address simplifies observing the application's behavior. This allows testing different request headers to trigger a 400 error in Tomcat. Exploring a temporary simplification of a location block within an Nginx configuration file is the current focus.\n\n\n**Analyzing Nginx Proxy Configuration**\n\nTesting a simplified location block in Nginx without including the external proxy configuration to understand the impact. Examining the contents of the included configuration file reveals several critical proxy directives, including those for HTTP version, header manipulation, and timeouts, with a notable `proxy_ssl_server_name on;` directive. This suggests a potential interaction with SNI and Tomcat or ModSecurity, which will now be investigated to identify the source of the 400 error.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"~/.ansible/kssh -u superuser 172.30.198.33 '\\npython3 -c '\\\\''\\nimport http.server\\nimport threading\\nimport time\\n\\nclass Handler(http.server.BaseHTTPRequestHandler):\\n    def do_GET(self):\\n        print(\\\"=== RECEIVED HEADERS FROM NGINX ===\\\")\\n        print(self.headers)\\n        self.send_response(200)\\n        self.end_headers()\\n        self.wfile.write(b\\\"OK\\\")\\n    def log_message(self, format, *args): pass\\n\\nserver = http.server.HTTPServer((\\\"127.0.0.1\\\", 9999), Handler)\\nt = threading.Thread(target=server.handle_request)\\nt.start()\\ntime.sleep(0.5)\\n\\nimport urllib.request\\n# Direct curl to mock server via python\\nreq = urllib.request.Request(\\\"http://127.0.0.1:9999/centreon-map/\\\")\\nurllib.request.urlopen(req)\\nt.join()\\n'\\\\''\"","Cwd":"\"/home/koby\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Running command\"","toolSummary":"\"Test mock server script\""}}]}
