{"step_index":198,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T08:40:50Z","thinking":"**Investigating Nginx Host Header Issue**\n\nThe discrepancy between Tomcat accepting the headers and Nginx returning an error is puzzling. The `curl` command used for Nginx testing includes `Host: map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443`. Examining the Nginx configuration reveals that the `Host` header is set to `$http_host`.\n\nThe value of `$http_host` during the `curl` test was `map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443`.\n\n\n**Analyzing Tomcat's 400 Response**\n\nThe access log confirms a 400 Bad Request from Tomcat, indicating the issue originates from the upstream server, not a connection problem. The absence of a corresponding error in the Nginx error log supports this. Now the focus shifts to why Tomcat is sending the 400.\n\nTo understand the request Nginx is sending to Tomcat, a test is set up to capture the headers. This involves configuring Nginx to proxy a specific location to a local listener, allowing inspection of the forwarded request details.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"~/.ansible/kssh -u superuser 172.30.198.33 '\\n# Start nc in background to capture 1 request\\n(nc -l -p 9998 > /tmp/nginx_raw_upstream.txt) &\\nNC_PID=$!\\nsleep 0.5\\n\\n# Test curling directly against 9998 through python or test what proxy generates\\npython3 -c '\\\\''\\nimport socket\\nimport ssl\\n\\n# Connect to Nginx port 9443\\ns = socket.create_connection((\\\"172.30.198.33\\\", 9443))\\nctx = ssl.create_default_context()\\nctx.check_hostname = False\\nctx.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE\\nss = ctx.wrap_socket(s)\\n\\n# Send request\\nss.sendall(b\\\"GET /centreon-map/ HTTP/1.1\\\\r\\\\nHost: map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443\\\\r\\\\nUser-Agent: curl/7.74.0\\\\r\\\\nAccept: */*\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\")\\nresp = ss.recv(4096)\\nprint(\\\"Response from Nginx:\\\")\\nprint(resp.decode(\\\"utf-8\\\", errors=\\\"replace\\\")[:300])\\n'\\\\''\\n'\"","Cwd":"\"/home/koby\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Running command\"","toolSummary":"\"Send raw HTTP request to Nginx\""}}]}
